{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/trouble-tickets/1205136-how-do-i-edit-my-signature","id":1205136,"title":"How do I edit my signature?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Trouble Tickets"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-10T04:13:47-07:00","id":1205136,"title":"How do I edit my signature?","content":"As the title says, I can't find where to alter my signature, which is silly because I used to know how. So, yeah. Help?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-10T04:18:17-07:00","id":1205137,"title":"","content":"<b>How do I edit my signature?</b><br /><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">You can set and change your signature by going to your username in the upper right corner &gt; click to get the drop down &gt; select <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/settings/account\">User Settings</a>. On that page, select the Account tab and then go down to the area that says &quot;Conversation Detail Options&quot;. On the right side, you will see the option &quot;Edit Post Signature&quot;. If you click that link, you will get a popup editor that will allow you to enter/edit your signature.</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">This option may be disabled by the Administrator. The Administrator may also have restrictions on how many lines or characters may be in the signature.</span><br /> <br /> <br /> Here you go <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-10T04:20:23-07:00","id":1205138,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maitrecorbo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/trouble-tickets/1205136-how-do-i-edit-my-signature?p=1205137#post1205137\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>How do I edit my signature?</b><br /><br /> <span style=\"font-family:inherit\">You can set and change your signature by going to your username in the upper right corner &gt; click to get the drop down &gt; select <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/settings/account\">User Settings</a>. On that page, select the Account tab and then go down to the area that says &quot;Conversation Detail Options&quot;. On the right side, you will see the option &quot;Edit Post Signature&quot;. If you click that link, 